cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MARS in your research, please cite this software."
title: "MARS: RNA modification detection from Nanopore direct-RNA sequencing data"
abstract: >-
  MARS is an analysis pipeline for detecting RNA modifications (m6A, m5C, m1A,
  pseudouridine, ac4C, f5C, h5C) from Oxford Nanopore direct-RNA sequencing
  data. It extracts joint quality-value and substitution-rate features around
  candidate sites and scores them with gradient-boosted trees.
type: software
version: 4.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-08"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/niujiale/MARS"
url: "https://github.com/niujiale/MARS"
keywords:
